WEBVTT

00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:30.983
with images of models
that have been photoshopped

00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:32.681
to where there's not a single pore,

00:01:32.705 --> 00:01:34.657
fat roll or stretch mark in sight.

00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:37.748
You don't need to look hard
to find examples.

00:01:38.485 --> 00:01:42.954
This definition of beauty is damaging,
dangerous and destructive,

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:45.511
and we need to explode it immediately.

00:01:46.017 --> 00:01:50.592
(Applause)

00:01:50.616 --> 00:01:51.957
I'm glad you agree.

00:01:51.981 --> 00:01:53.131
(Laughter)

00:01:53.751 --> 00:01:56.235
One of the worst things
I've realized over the years

00:01:56.259 --> 00:01:58.330
is that my experience
with disordered eating

00:01:58.354 --> 00:01:59.608
is not an anomaly.

00:01:59.632 --> 00:02:01.910
In fact, it's par for the course.